      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرْدَادٌ</span></b>  The <i>elephant:</i> (O, K:) because of his
thickness and bulkiness. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>Courageous, and hard,</i> or <i>sturdy;</i> (O, K;) applied to
a man. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A staff by means of
which the horse and the camel are tied.</i> (O, K.)

